#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:1
#: 42ae4f5bd4234aaba47d69017a5e8333
msgid "Classical Radial DEA: Resource Stewardship and Service Expansion"
msgstr "经典径向 DEA：资源使用责任与服务扩张"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:3
#: 2b8a109b6d1545b887b4dc5d0c710063
msgid ""
"A service authority enters its annual planning round with two legitimate but"
" different responsibilities. The finance team must protect agreed service "
"levels while testing whether branches need all of their present resources. "
"The operations team must respect the approved resource envelope while asking"
" whether citizens could receive more service. A single number cannot answer "
"both questions unless the report first says which commitment is being held "
"fixed."
msgstr "公共服务主管机构进入年度规划时，承担着两项都合理、却并不相同的责任。财务团队既要保障已经约定的服务水平，又要检验各分支机构是否确实需要当前全部资源。运营团队则要遵守获批的资源限额，同时考察公众能否获得更多服务。除非报告先说明哪一项责任必须保持不变，否则一个数字无法同时回答这两个问题。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:10
#: fd1d775b0205440fb25de6a33efacc4b
msgid ""
"Classical radial DEA turns those responsibilities into two transparent "
"performance questions. One asks what common share of each controllable "
"resource would have been enough to preserve current services. The other asks"
" how far all desirable services could rise within the current resource "
"envelope. These questions give boards a readable first indication of "
"resource stewardship or service capacity without pretending to diagnose "
"every individual shortfall. Their simplicity is useful only when a common "
"percentage is plausible for the organization being studied."
msgstr ""
"经典径向 DEA "
"把上述责任转化为两个清晰的绩效问题。第一个问题是：在维持现有服务的前提下，每项可控资源共同保留多大比例便已足够？第二个问题是：在当前资源限额内，所有合意服务还能共同增加多少？这两个问题可以为决策机构提供易于理解的资源使用责任或服务能力初步判断，却不假称已经诊断出每一项具体缺口。只有当共同百分比调整符合被研究组织的经营实际时，这种简洁性才有意义。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:18
#: 963716e43e914d5299b0227583dc360a
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The study-design and production-technology chapters have already established"
" the production story, variable roles, eligible peers, and permissible scale"
" comparisons; see {doc}`../01-foundations/02-study-design` and "
"{doc}`../01-foundations/02-production-frontier`. The present question is how"
" large an operating shortfall those opportunities reveal. What matters is "
"not the shape of a diagram but the responsibility assigned to management and"
" the commitment that the benchmark must protect."
msgstr ""
"研究设计章和生产技术章已经确定了生产过程、变量角色、合格比较对象以及允许采用的规模比较；参见 {doc}`../01-foundations/02"
"-study-design` 和 {doc}`../01-foundations/02-production-"
"frontier`。本章要回答的是：这些生产机会揭示了多大的经营缺口。关键不在图形的形状，而在管理层承担什么责任，以及标杆必须保障哪项承诺。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:27
#: 6b117aa496cc4b1d8f22a8ea2b91e0af
msgid "Orientation begins with what management must protect"
msgstr "导向取决于管理层必须保障什么"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:29
#: 0ea04bfe3b344cf38e792a59fddc38ce
msgid ""
"Orientation identifies the side of the operation that is treated as a "
"commitment."
msgstr "导向规定把经营活动的哪一侧视为必须履行的承诺。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:31
#: b52b79d5b57a400d83fd8cf57942ed1c
msgid ""
"Input orientation protects the represented output commitments and asks how "
"much of every controllable input could be saved."
msgstr "投入导向保障既定产出责任，并考察每项可控投入可以节约多少。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:33
#: f65ab00fd6454e3b9697fb7956c977fa
msgid ""
"Output orientation holds the represented input limits fixed and asks how "
"much every desirable output could expand."
msgstr "产出导向保持既定投入限额不变，并考察每项合意产出可以扩张多少。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:36
#: 1adbc798b79d48ccb3ee9ee79812d899
msgid "Returns to scale records which resizing comparisons the benchmark may use."
msgstr "规模报酬规定标杆可以采用哪些经营规模调整比较。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:38
#: 8f8c1a60e7374c4ca529b5005c276030
msgid ""
"Constant returns to scale (CRS) admits proportional replication of observed "
"operating patterns. The performance comparison therefore includes whether "
"the organization is operating at a productive scale."
msgstr "规模报酬不变（CRS）允许按比例复制观测到的经营模式。因此，绩效比较也包含组织是否处在具有生产率优势的经营规模这一问题。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:41
#: 2c242d4e42434706aaa76583c5b5c5e2
msgid ""
"Variable returns to scale (VRS) forms convex combinations without granting "
"unrestricted proportional replication. It asks how well resources are used "
"under the maintained locally scaled opportunity set."
msgstr "规模报酬可变（VRS）允许形成凸组合，但不赋予不受限制的同比例复制权。它考察在所设定的、随局部经营规模变化的生产机会集合下，资源使用得如何。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:45
#: a5534629e1e8498f832bf6bf81fbac18
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Crossing these two decisions gives four familiar specifications, all "
"belonging to the same Farrell radial family "
"{cite:p}`farrell1957,charnes1978,banker1984`:"
msgstr ""
"把导向与规模报酬这两项选择交叉起来，就得到四种熟悉的设定；它们都属于同一个 Farrell 径向模型族 "
"{cite:p}`farrell1957,charnes1978,banker1984`："

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md
#: 08ed7ddb6225453c862808264298fbf0
msgid "Protected commitment and allowed change"
msgstr "受到保障的承诺与允许发生的变化"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md
#: 438491d3b0f045469b33bb928009e461
