#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:55
#: 060cdf006d974f99887c87bdb3519d05
msgid ""
"CCR and BCC are historically important names, but neither acronym settles "
"the orientation. CCR identifies the CRS specialization of the parent family;"
" BCC identifies its VRS specialization. The suffixes I and O complete the "
"contract by stating which side of the production account management is "
"allowed to change. Names such as *CCR model*, *BCC model*, *Farrell input "
"measure*, and *radial envelopment model* therefore describe closely related "
"views or specializations, not a catalogue of unrelated algorithms."
msgstr ""
"CCR 和 BCC 是具有重要历史意义的名称，但任何一个缩写都没有确定导向。CCR 表示母模型族在 CRS 下的专门形式，BCC 表示其 VRS "
"专门形式。后缀 I 和 O 说明允许管理层改变生产账户的哪一侧，从而补全模型契约。因此，*CCR 模型*、*BCC 模型*、*Farrell "
"投入测度*和*径向包络模型*等名称描述的是关系紧密的不同表示或专门形式，而不是一系列彼此无关的算法。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:63
#: a304b79fb7ee4d1d858d8f10f57deaf9
msgid ""
"This unification does not make the choices interchangeable. BCC-I and BCC-O "
"protect different commitments. CCR-I and BCC-I grant the benchmark different"
" resizing rights. A defensible study selects both choices before looking at "
"the ranking and reports them as part of the result's meaning."
msgstr ""
"这样的统一并不意味着各项选择可以互换。BCC-I 与 BCC-O 保障不同的承诺；CCR-I 与 BCC-I "
"则赋予标杆不同的经营规模调整权。可信的研究应在查看排序之前就确定这两项选择，并把它们作为结果含义的一部分加以报告。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:68
#: 1c209e5c46654b3c82d410b262277258
msgid "Translate the management question into a benchmark programme"
msgstr "把管理问题写成标杆方案"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:70
#: 1bf1ab38c89947a9825657d09479478f
msgid "For organization $o$, the input-oriented CRS programme is"
msgstr "对于组织 $o$，投入导向的 CRS 规划为"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:72
#: 6b5709b0ea3b421d919d89e81d67e549
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\min_{\\theta,\\lambda}\\quad &\\theta\\\\\n"
"\\text{subject to}\\quad\n"
"&X\\lambda\\leq\\theta x_o,\\\\\n"
"&Y\\lambda\\geq y_o,\\\\\n"
"&\\lambda\\geq0.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\min_{\\theta,\\lambda}\\quad &\\theta\\\\\n"
"\\text{约束条件}\\quad\n"
"&X\\lambda\\leq\\theta x_o,\\\\\n"
"&Y\\lambda\\geq y_o,\\\\\n"
"&\\lambda\\geq0.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:82
#: 58b4b211b94146cbae35e992ae400f59
msgid ""
"The reference activity must protect the organization's service commitments "
"while using no more than the common proportion $\\theta$ of every "
"represented input. Minimizing $\\theta$ finds the smallest supported "
"resource-retention factor. When the observed operation belongs to the "
"reference technology, $\\theta\\leq1$ and $1-\\theta$ is the supported "
"common proportional saving. Adding $\\mathbf 1^\\top\\lambda=1$ changes the "
"benchmark from CRS to VRS without changing the resource-stewardship "
"question."
msgstr ""
"参照生产活动必须保障该组织的服务承诺，同时每项代表性投入的使用量不得超过原值的共同份额 $\\theta$。最小化 "
"$\\theta$，得到证据能够支持的最小资源保留系数。当观测经营方案属于参照技术时，$\\theta\\leq1$，而 $1-\\theta$ "
"就是可以支持的共同投入节约比例。加入 $\\mathbf 1^\\top\\lambda=1$，便把标杆从 CRS 改为 "
"VRS，但资源使用责任问题本身没有改变。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:90
#: 317bb140b0134fb6aa7e88ff45c04f49
msgid "The output-oriented counterpart is"
msgstr "相应的产出导向规划为"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:92
#: fd22a557fdf24181b50259927999f09e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\max_{\\phi,\\lambda}\\quad &\\phi\\\\\n"
"\\text{subject to}\\quad\n"
"&X\\lambda\\leq x_o,\\\\\n"
"&Y\\lambda\\geq\\phi y_o,\\\\\n"
"&\\lambda\\geq0,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\max_{\\phi,\\lambda}\\quad &\\phi\\\\\n"
"\\text{约束条件}\\quad\n"
"&X\\lambda\\leq x_o,\\\\\n"
"&Y\\lambda\\geq\\phi y_o,\\\\\n"
"&\\lambda\\geq0,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:102
#: 63f9e8aa33674625ab0240535d2c9588
msgid ""
"again with $\\mathbf 1^\\top\\lambda=1$ for VRS. Here the resource limits "
"are protected and $\\phi$ is the largest common service-expansion factor; "
"$\\phi-1$ is the supported proportional increase when the observed operation"
" belongs to the reference technology. The two programmes use the same "
"production account but hold different quantities fixed. In the ordinary "
"self-inclusive appraisal, their native values therefore run in opposite "
"numerical directions: $\\theta\\leq1$ is better when closer to one, whereas "
"$\\phi\\geq1$ is better when closer to one. DEAPack's standardized output "
"efficiency $1/\\phi$ is a reporting transform, not a second performance "
"model."
msgstr ""
"VRS 情形同样加入 $\\mathbf 1^\\top\\lambda=1$。此时资源限额受到保障，$\\phi$ "
"是最大的共同服务扩张因子；当观测经营方案属于参照技术时，$\\phi-1$ "
"是证据能够支持的产出增长比例。两个规划采用同一个生产账户，但固定的数量不同。因此，在通常包含被评价单元自身的评价中，两种原生值的数值方向相反：$\\theta\\leq1$"
" 时越接近 1 越好，而 $\\phi\\geq1$ 时同样越接近 1 越好。DEAPack 报告的标准化产出效率 $1/\\phi$ "
"只是结果变换，并不是第二个绩效模型。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:112
#: ac7dc21ea372479f9344b6c423031300
msgid ""
"An external or leave-group-out reference may not contain the evaluated "
"operation. Then $\\theta$ can exceed one or $\\phi$ can fall below one: "
"reaching the external benchmark requires a reverse adjustment rather than "
"revealing an ordinary saving or expansion from the observed plan. Such "
"values should remain visible as benchmark-relative comparisons, but they do "
"not inherit the usual $[0,1]$ efficiency interpretation or a self-inclusive "
"efficiency classification."
msgstr ""
"外部参照或留组外参照可能不包含被评价的经营方案。此时，$\\theta$ 可能大于 1，$\\phi$ 也可能小于 "
"1：要达到外部标杆，需要作反向调整，而不是从观测方案中识别通常意义上的投入节约或产出扩张。这些数值仍应作为相对于标杆的比较如实呈现，但不能沿用通常的 "
"$[0,1]$ 效率解释，也不能据此作出自包含效率分类。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:119
#: 0aa131590e4b4759b7457d395991cedd
msgid "The CRS input programme has an equivalent multiplier account:"
msgstr "CRS 投入规划具有如下等价的乘数核算形式："

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:121
#: d139bb1471254a29893581bbdf87b849
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\max_{u,v}\\quad &u^\\top y_o\\\\\n"
"\\text{subject to}\\quad\n"
"&v^\\top x_o=1,\\\\\n"
"&u^\\top Y-v^\\top X\\leq0,\\\\\n"
"&u,v\\geq0.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\max_{u,v}\\quad &u^\\top y_o\\\\\n"
"\\text{约束条件}\\quad\n"
"&v^\\top x_o=1,\\\\\n"
"&u^\\top Y-v^\\top X\\leq0,\\\\\n"
"&u,v\\geq0.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:131
#: 63c56ea87c7f4bd0821186183c6ba2fc
msgid ""
"The normalization fixes the unit of account. Organization $o$ receives the "
"most favorable nonnegative input and output valuations that remain "
"admissible for every organization in the comparison population. Linear-"
"programming duality makes this optimum equal to the envelopment score. These"
" multipliers are endogenous shadow valuations under the model, not observed "
"prices or estimates of social value. Under VRS, a free intercept accompanies"
" the convexity constraint and permits local increasing, constant, or "
"decreasing returns."
msgstr ""
"归一化确定了核算单位。组织 $o$ "
"获得对自己最有利的非负投入与产出价值权重，但这些权重对比较总体中的每个组织都必须可接受。线性规划对偶性使这一最优值等于包络形式的效率得分。这些乘数是模型内生的影子价值，并非观测价格，也不是社会价值的估计。在"
" VRS 下，凸性约束对应一个自由截距，从而允许局部规模报酬递增、不变或递减。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:140
#: 452fc1a8cdf7493db900fdd357c7bdb6
msgid ""
"The programme is now formally complete, but two institutional questions "
"still decide whether its benchmark is credible. First, may a favorable "
"valuation give almost no recognition to a mandated service? Second, may "
"several observed practices be combined into one attainable operating plan? "
"Both questions qualify the evidence admitted to the same radial account."
msgstr "至此，规划在形式上已经完整，但其标杆是否可信仍取决于两个制度问题。第一，最有利的价值评价能否几乎不考虑某项法定服务？第二，能否把多个观测实践组合成一个可实现的经营方案？这两个问题都会限定同一径向账户所接纳的证据。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:146
#: f8f9f4ae0d51477abe114eb318352bc4
msgid "Ask whether the favorable valuation respects public commitments"
msgstr "检验最有利的价值评价是否尊重公共服务责任"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:148
#: d4f38bbf43484a47a1c7fc572d7d8b50
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Allowing each organization to choose its own multipliers is deliberate. It "
"lets a hospital, school, or branch be assessed under the most favorable "
"relative valuation that the observed production evidence will support, "
"without pretending that reliable market prices exist. The resulting score "
"therefore answers a conditional question: *can this organization be shown to"
" perform well under any admissible valuation of the represented resources "
"and services?* {cite:p}`ray2004`."
msgstr ""
"允许每个组织选择自己的乘数是有意的设计。它使医院、学校或分支机构可以在观测生产证据能够支持的最有利相对价值评价下接受考察，而不必假定存在可靠的市场价格。因此，得分回答的是一个条件性问题：*在对所列资源和服务的任一可接受价值评价下，能否说明这个组织表现良好？*"
" {cite:p}`ray2004`。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:156
#: 5e13930f9bea4d70abdc457b5e0dfc61
msgid ""
"That freedom can also expose a weak performance story. A multiplier may be "
"zero or extremely small because the corresponding variable does not help the"
" organization's most favorable account. This does not establish that a "
"service is worthless or that a resource is costless. For example, a hospital"
" might look strong only when emergency-care quality receives almost no "
"recognition. The numerical result is then valid for the unrestricted DEA "
"question, but it may be too narrow for an authority that has an explicit "
"duty to protect both access and quality."
msgstr ""
"这种自由也可能暴露出薄弱的绩效叙事。某个乘数可能为零或极小，只因为相应变量无助于形成该组织最有利的评价账户。这并不能说明某项服务没有价值，或某项资源没有成本。例如，一家医院可能只有在急诊服务质量几乎不受重视时才显得表现突出。对于不受限的"
" DEA 问题，这一数值结果仍然有效；但对负有同时保障可及性与质量明确责任的主管机构而言，这种评价可能过于狭窄。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:165
#: f25e46f3374c418eb988ee09ab676fc3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"When credible institutional knowledge exists, the comparison can admit only "
"valuations consistent with it. Management might require every mandated "
"service to receive material recognition, bound the relative importance of "
"two outcomes, or state a feasible production trade-off such as how much "
"additional staff is normally required to protect an extra unit of service. "
"Such restrictions should express prior policy, engineering, or professional "
"knowledge—not be selected after inspecting which bounds produce a preferred "
"ranking. They can change scores, peers, and targets because they change the "
"valuation or production statements under which performance is judged "
"{cite:p}`allen1997,dyson2001,cooper2011handbook`."
msgstr ""
"如果存在可信的制度知识，比较就可以只允许与之相符的价值权重。管理层可以要求每项法定服务都获得实质性权重，限制两项结果的相对重要性，或者声明一种可行的生产权衡，例如通常需要增加多少员工才能保障额外一单位服务。这些限制应反映事先掌握的政策、工程或专业知识，而不能在看过哪些界限会产生偏好排序之后再作选择。它们会改变得分、活跃参照单元和目标方案，因为它们改变了绩效判断所依据的价值或生产命题"
" {cite:p}`allen1997,dyson2001,cooper2011handbook`。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:176
#: 88920e8bba44414a853a9cbaec138f9a
msgid ""
"Assurance-region and cone-ratio formulations are established ways to encode "
"these admissible weights or trade-offs. They are governance qualifications "
"to the parent radial account, not new efficiency families. A defensible "
"report still names its orientation and scale assumption, states the added "
"value judgement in substantive units, and shows how the conclusion differs "
"from the unrestricted appraisal."
msgstr "保证域和锥比形式是表达这些可接受权重或权衡关系的成熟方法。它们是对母径向账户的治理性限定，并不是新的效率模型族。可信的报告仍须说明导向和规模报酬假设，以有实质意义的单位表述新增的价值判断，并展示结论相对于不受限评价发生了什么变化。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:183
#: 93500648c8f74fdcb78e2a90446b3361
msgid ""
"DEAPack's package Documentation gives one source-qualified implementation of"
" that idea: the [finite input-oriented CRS polyhedral cone-ratio "
"leaf](https://deapack.readthedocs.io/en/latest/models/polyhedral-cone-"
"ratio.html). It requires declared generator provenance and keeps transformed"
" cone residuals separate from ordinary input excesses, output shortfalls, "
"and managerial targets. That technical leaf supports an audit of a valuation"
" policy; it does not turn every historical weight restriction into another "
"option of the classical radial model developed here."
msgstr ""
"DEAPack 的包 Documentation 给出了这一思想的一种经过来源核验的实现：[有限投入导向 CRS "
"多面锥比叶模型](https://deapack.readthedocs.io/en/latest/models/polyhedral-cone-"
"ratio.html)。它要求声明生成锥的来源，并把变换后的锥残差与通常的投入冗余、产出不足和管理目标方案分开。这一技术叶模型可用于审计某项价值权重政策，但并不会把历史上的每一种权重限制都变成本章经典径向模型的另一个选项。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:192
#: 77440d66053140bebe11db52c569acd3
msgid "Ask whether complete practices or mixtures can teach"
msgstr "检验完整实践还是实践组合更适合作为学习依据"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:194
#: 60ec2e33f008448eb4442f172ca130ba
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The same radial performance question can rest on a different learning right."
" Convex VRS treats mixtures of observed organizations as attainable when "
"capacity is divisible, service designs can be combined, or portfolios can be"
" rebalanced. The free-disposal hull (FDH) withholds that averaging right and"
" lets one complete observed practice support a benchmark at a time "
"{cite:p}`deprins1984`. This may be more credible when a municipality must "
"adopt a whole waste-treatment design or a hospital must compare indivisible "
"care pathways."
msgstr ""
"同一个径向绩效问题可以建立在不同的学习权利之上。当生产能力可以分割、服务设计能够组合或业务组合可以重新配置时，凸 VRS "
"把观测组织的组合视为可实现方案。自由处置包络（free-disposal "
"hull，FDH）不赋予这种平均组合权，而是每次只允许一个完整的观测实践支持标杆 "
"{cite:p}`deprins1984`。当市政机构必须采用一整套垃圾处理设计，或者医院只能比较不可分割的诊疗路径时，这种设定可能更可信。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:202
#: bc904f88fa9a4c62bc32ea88a892efff
msgid ""
"Nothing about this choice changes what input or output orientation protects."
" It changes the evidence allowed to support the operating comparison. Under "
"FDH the focal organization must be dominated by a complete observed "
"practice; under convex VRS it may also be dominated by a supported mixture. "
"That is why FDH belongs in the same classical radial discussion without "
"being relabelled as another BCC option."
msgstr ""
"这一选择并不改变投入导向或产出导向所保障的对象；它改变的是哪些证据可以支持经营比较。在 FDH 下，被评价组织必须受到一个完整观测实践的支配；在凸 "
"VRS 下，也可以受到一个有证据支持的实践组合支配。因此，FDH 应归入同一个经典径向讨论，却不能被重新命名为 BCC 的又一个选项。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:209
#: 90eb2e21fe96467eafb680ab3bba0620
msgid ""
"FDH follows observed-practice steps while convex VRS joins observations and "
"can support a more demanding synthetic target"
msgstr "FDH 沿观测实践形成阶梯，而凸 VRS 连接观测值，并可能支持要求更高的合成目标方案"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:214
#: f0230352b1274cd1a5c83af902418c24
msgid ""
"The same evidence under two learning assumptions. FDH asks whether a "
"complete observed practice dominates the focal operation. Convex VRS also "
"admits intermediate mixtures and can therefore set a more demanding "
"benchmark."
msgstr "同一组证据下的两种学习假设。FDH 检验一个完整观测实践是否支配被评价经营方案；凸 VRS 还允许中间组合，因此可能设定要求更高的标杆。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:219
#: b4ee6bd1a53540fc9f8afb447bbcf422
msgid ""
"The distinction is easy to reproduce on the one-input, one-output teaching "
"data:"
msgstr "这一差别可以在单投入、单产出的教学数据上直接复现："

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:242
#: 15d50a05b2344f7d861bc6a8278eafe7
msgid ""
"For branch H, output efficiency is about 0.909 under FDH and 0.845 under "
"convex VRS. H is compared with a less demanding observed-practice step under"
" FDH; VRS additionally treats a mixture of observed practices as attainable."
" The difference is not evidence that one calculation is wrong. It measures "
"how much of H's assessed shortfall depends on the claim that practices can "
"be combined."
msgstr ""
"对于分支机构 H，FDH 下的产出效率约为 0.909，凸 VRS 下约为 0.845。FDH 把 H 与要求较低的观测实践阶梯比较；VRS "
"还把观测实践的组合视为可实现方案。这种差异并不说明其中一个计算有误，而是衡量 H 的被评估缺口有多少取决于“实践可以组合”这一命题。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:249
#: 4ff5182547764df1a7c602b51fc0a338
msgid ""
"FDH is thus a principal alternative benchmark technology inside the "
"classical radial family, not a new orientation and not “BCC with an option "
"switched off.” It has no ordinary CRS/VRS toggle: removing convexification "
"is the point of the comparison. If several observations tie, they are "
"alternative observed comparators rather than weights in one synthetic peer. "
"A credible study should say why complete observed practices or convex "
"mixtures provide the more defensible evidence and use the other construction"
" as a sensitivity check when both are plausible."
msgstr ""
"因此，FDH 是经典径向模型族内部一种主要的替代性标杆技术，而不是新的导向，也不是“关闭某个选项的 BCC”。它不存在通常的 CRS/VRS "
"开关；不进行凸化正是这一比较的要点。若多个观测值并列，它们是可替代的观测比较对象，而不是同一个合成参照方案中的权重。可信的研究应说明为何完整观测实践或凸组合能够提供更可靠的证据；当两者都合理时，还应把另一种构造作为敏感性检验。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:258
#: 6f0982e5801e46c4a4dd474b95649c0f
msgid "Read the movement as an operating comparison"
msgstr "把调整理解为经营比较"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:260
#: c4b579d4aa45454f9a4fc5d7408d5577
msgid ""
"Consider eight branches using one standardized measure of staff capacity to "
"deliver one standardized service. Under an input-oriented VRS comparison, "
"branches inside the best-practice boundary are connected to operating plans "
"that protect their recorded service while using less staff capacity."
msgstr ""
"设想八个分支机构使用一项标准化的人员能力指标来提供一项标准化服务。在投入导向 VRS "
"比较中，最佳实践边界以内的分支机构会与这样的经营方案相联系：既保障其记录的服务，又使用更少的人员能力。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:265
#: 2f8fafe9f12e44a29448ed4537145d3f
msgid ""
"A complete radial fit carries two claims even when a two-dimensional picture"
" makes them look like one movement. Phase one reports the common "
"proportional commitment: use at most $\\theta x_o$ under input orientation, "
"or supply at least $\\phi y_o$ under output orientation. Phase two holds "
"that fitted factor fixed and asks whether any individual resource can still "
"be saved or any individual service can still be added. Thus `score` and "
"`is_radially_efficient` describe the proportional claim; `slacks`, "
"`targets`, and `is_efficient` describe the selected completed plan. "
"Completion may change the reported target, but it never revises $\\theta$ or"
" $\\phi$."
msgstr ""
"一次完整的径向拟合包含两项主张，即使二维图形看起来只有一次移动。第一阶段报告共同的比例承诺：投入导向下最多使用 $\\theta "
"x_o$，产出导向下至少提供 $\\phi "
"y_o$。第二阶段保持该因子不变，再检验某项具体资源能否进一步节约，或某项具体服务能否进一步增加。因此，`score` 和 "
"`is_radially_efficient` 描述比例主张；`slacks`、`targets` 和 `is_efficient` "
"描述选定的完整方案。补全步骤可能改变报告的目标方案，但绝不会改写 $\\theta$ 或 $\\phi$。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:275
#: 41e86f12687b40d49f62e37bf33b6224
msgid "The result is easiest to govern as a layered operating account:"
msgstr "最便于治理的做法，是把结果整理成分层的经营账户："

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:209
#: 3c91b7d49a594b3c882ef1180ad10cc3
msgid "Evidence"
msgstr "证据"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:209
#: 18bd8a2320bd4df499b724803478ba71
msgid "What it can support"
msgstr "能够支持什么"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:209
#: 6d886b204dd543aa8f48f2fbf93247f1
msgid "What it cannot establish by itself"
msgstr "仅凭自身不能说明什么"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:209
#: 7d66461b04844266806f38b918339531
msgid "Native $\\theta$ or $\\phi$"
msgstr "原生 $\\theta$ 或 $\\phi$"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:209
#: 747f10c1c69b4234933589cdc19c7861
msgid ""
"the minimized retained-input share or maximized output multiple under the "
"declared orientation"
msgstr "在所声明导向下，最小化的投入保留份额或最大化的产出倍数"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:209
#: 8f36a56d97d24ff180e10d4ff4e75dd4
msgid "variable-specific gaps, a causal explanation, or an implementation order"
msgstr "逐项缺口、因果解释或实施顺序"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:209
#: 6c5488b9ffe043808724c45e13916beb
msgid "Phase-one radial plan"
msgstr "第一阶段径向方案"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:209
#: 44be40a157474e268d9c15d8070d6642
msgid "the quantities implied by that common movement"
msgstr "由共同调整所得到的数量"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:209
#: e900c97ea47246b4af79f745ea0b17a5
msgid "a Pareto--Koopmans complete plan when slacks remain"
msgstr "存在松弛量时的 Pareto--Koopmans 完整方案"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:209
#: 23951a77d0c14ae7a0bfe43e0f661e46
msgid "Slacks and completed target"
msgstr "松弛量与补全后的目标方案"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:209
#: 725ae13ebb614ceea321cc2b1723f21a
msgid ""
"additional represented input savings or service gains after the radial "
"optimum is held fixed"
msgstr "保持径向最优值不变后，仍可支持的额外投入节约或服务增加"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:209
#: e7f5c3a0954c44cc9a0601fca4385ae7
msgid "the unique, cheapest, or politically feasible transition plan"
msgstr "唯一、成本最低或政治上可行的转型方案"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:209
#: f636b39e08354cb294f1cef44bb4d0d7
msgid "Peer intensities"
msgstr "参照强度"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:209
#: dce86adb4e8e48f6a67b7c69cc452599
msgid "the observed activities that support the selected comparison"
msgstr "支持所选比较的观测生产活动"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:209
#: 9b8d58caf94c4d65b39b969718d860db
msgid "proof that peer management caused the result or should be copied literally"
msgstr "活跃参照单元的管理行为造成结果或应当被原样照搬的证明"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:284
#: 27eb70f18f9c44b5b0b47a7fca1ca8b2
msgid ""
"This hierarchy prevents a concise score from being asked to carry evidence "
"that only the completion and peer accounts contain."
msgstr "这一层级避免让一个简洁得分承担只有补全账户和参照账户才能提供的证据。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:287
#: 9ea589c18a254e06a5cb7f62e0edd12d
msgid ""
"The public peer rows belong to the selected slack-completed target when that"
" completion is requested. The phase-one score establishes that at least one "
"radial comparison supports $\\theta$ or $\\phi$; it does not make the peers "
"of a later selected target the unique intensity solution to the phase-one "
"programme."
msgstr ""
"如果请求了松弛量补全，公开的活跃参照单元记录属于所选的松弛量补全目标。第一阶段得分说明至少存在一个径向比较能够支持 $\\theta$ 或 "
"$\\phi$；它并不意味着后来所选目标方案的活跃参照单元就是第一阶段规划唯一的强度变量解。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:292
#: a11ce5f503734e9caae8078951b25dc6
msgid ""
"Eight service branches are compared under a variable-returns technology, "
"with input-oriented plans for interior branches preserving recorded service "
"while requiring less staff capacity"
msgstr "八个服务分支机构在规模报酬可变技术下接受比较；对于边界内部的分支机构，投入导向方案既保障其记录的服务，又要求更少的人员能力"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:297
#: 04980377d1344e82b8c31e8cfe61e7ce
msgid ""
"An input-oriented BCC comparison. Each interior branch is compared with a "
"feasible operating plan that preserves its recorded service while requiring "
"less staff capacity. The plan is a benchmark opportunity, not a causal "
"diagnosis or an implementation order. In this scalar case no additional "
"variable-specific improvement remains after the proportional resource "
"saving, so the proportional and completed plans happen to coincide."
msgstr ""
"投入导向 BCC "
"比较。每个边界内部的分支机构都与一个可行经营方案比较；该方案保障其记录的服务，同时需要较少人员能力。这个方案代表一种标杆机会，不是因果诊断或实施命令。在这个单变量案例中，共同比例节约资源后不再存在额外的逐项改进，因此比例方案与补全方案恰好一致。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:305
#: 3a046e7c08e44c1a90b9cedbbaed18c2
msgid ""
"For branch E, input orientation asks what resource commitment is sufficient "
"for its recorded service. Output orientation instead keeps E's resource "
"budget and asks what service level that budget could support. Changing the "
"orientation changes what is protected and what is allowed to move; it is not"
" a robustness switch to be chosen after inspecting the scores."
msgstr ""
"对于分支机构 E，投入导向问的是：要履行其记录的服务责任，多少资源承诺已经足够？产出导向则保持 E "
"的资源预算不变，考察该预算能够支持何种服务水平。改变导向会改变所保障的对象和允许变化的对象；它不是查看得分后再选择的稳健性开关。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:311
#: a5a0f620bed14d1fbe5af4e2c4a6f321
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Changing CRS to VRS asks a different question. CRS treats a productive "
"operating pattern as proportionally replicable at other scales. VRS does not"
" grant that right. A lower CRS than VRS efficiency can therefore reflect the"
" additional scale comparison admitted by CRS. It does not by itself reveal "
"whether an organization should expand or contract. The dedicated {doc"
"}`scale-performance-management` chapter separates scale efficiency, local "
"returns to scale, and radial elasticity. The first compares matched CRS and "
"VRS performance accounts; the latter two describe the response near a "
"selected efficient plan. Those quantities should not be collapsed into one "
"interpretation."
msgstr ""
"把 CRS 改为 VRS 回答的是另一个问题。CRS 认为具有生产率优势的经营模式可以在其他规模上按比例复制，VRS 则不赋予这种权利。因此，CRS "
"效率低于 VRS 效率可能反映 CRS 所增加的规模比较。仅凭这一点，无法判断组织应当扩张还是收缩。专门的 {doc}`scale-"
"performance-management` 一章区分了规模效率、局部规模报酬和径向弹性。第一项比较匹配的 CRS 与 VRS "
"绩效账户，后两项描述所选有效方案附近的反应。这些数量不能合并成一种解释。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:321
#: b0ea24f1ac5a47d5a04489e82746dea8
msgid "Fit the four complete contracts"
msgstr "拟合四种完整契约"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:323
#: 4a1999fc42564b24a5c216b982968a24
msgid ""
"The deterministic `frontier_1x1` data make the two decisions visible without"
" hiding them inside a large application:"
msgstr "确定性的 `frontier_1x1` 数据把这两项选择清楚展示出来，而不会让它们隐藏在大型应用中："

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:292
#: 4dcb789b950f4bddba742d6b5b01a4a2
msgid "Contract"
msgstr "契约"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:292
#: a43bb0ca412545afb6db8800bb54dd71
msgid "Native score"
msgstr "原生得分"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:292
#: c9a5964d298b4bf482efcdbe92b24075
msgid "Standardized efficiency"
msgstr "标准化效率"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:292
#: 0811e217fbfb4137b66a7a8ecdda0854
msgid "Radially efficient?"
msgstr "径向有效？"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:292
#: 7636b18504bc4f6999f8a263189907b9
msgid "Strongly efficient?"
msgstr "强有效？"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:292
#: ab74863bcd7c4256937585c0df3f84e4 b770ca46478e4c1f95dcbcfbbed7df72
#: bb90826b51104c63b12f8d01d081c922 f82df0df4cc44dfc91e6738ae70a345d
msgid "0.6000"
msgstr "0.6000"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:292
#: 27b56c5713e94856a0dbb79974c7039c 28be8e35f12840539b2178272dea1ab3
#: 2bf68cf6f96d482c9958c0a488c8ed99 2d80ce7f53a149b68dd7ba13ec6974cc
#: 6667eb2cf21e4720a1a2ef59c92c38c7 8af8c4eed00c4ff6b9319c7e2a1b5ada
#: ac5d9003646b4e31842ff4940d4815ce baada96c0178424080ad3161e39e2589
msgid "no"
msgstr "否"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:292
#: 28a64baaf71848ef8a48aa48c834fa2d 896bd0c031914d9792653f2f2484857f
msgid "1.6667"
msgstr "1.6667"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:292
#: acbcb522024740f5942de3884d9c8dd1 bc3661eca4b84f4290c045845f930546
msgid "0.6667"
msgstr "0.6667"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:381
#: 4d6563307fc646e8a3ad8345722c7540
msgid ""
"For the two input-oriented contracts, `score` is the retained resource "
"factor $\\theta$. Thus $\\theta_E=0.60$ under CCR-I means that the CRS "
"benchmark uses 60 percent of E's represented inputs while protecting its "
"outputs: the proportional resource-saving opportunity is 40 percent. Input-"
"oriented `efficiency` reports the same $\\theta$."
msgstr ""
"对于两个投入导向契约，`score` 是资源保留因子 $\\theta$。因此，CCR-I 下的 $\\theta_E=0.60$ 表示：CRS "
"标杆在保障 E 的产出的同时，只使用其代表性投入的 60%；共同的资源节约机会为 40%。投入导向的 `efficiency` 报告同一个 "
"$\\theta$。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:387
#: abae8681560a41509144bbecf2fee2ac
msgid ""
"For the two output-oriented contracts, `score` is the native expansion "
"factor $\\phi$. A value $\\phi_E=1.6667$ means that the benchmark supports "
"about 1.667 times E's represented outputs with its inputs held fixed. "
"DEAPack reports the reciprocal $1/\\phi_E=0.60$ in `efficiency`, so the "
"standardized efficiency field remains higher-is-better in both orientations."
msgstr ""
"对于两个产出导向契约，`score` 是原生扩张因子 $\\phi$。$\\phi_E=1.6667$ 表示：在投入保持不变时，标杆能够支持约为 E "
"当前代表性产出 1.667 倍的产出。DEAPack 在 `efficiency` 中报告其倒数 "
"$1/\\phi_E=0.60$，因而两个导向下的标准化效率字段都保持越高越好的方向。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:393
#: 4b3e334d444140468bd7f3a4f51f6ad7
msgid ""
"The distinction between `score` and `efficiency` should remain visible in an"
" audit trail. Comparing the native `score` columns across orientations would"
" mix a contraction factor with an expansion factor. In this scalar case the "
"harmonized CRS efficiencies coincide, but the input- and output-oriented "
"experiments still protect different quantities."
msgstr ""
"审计记录应当保留 `score` 与 `efficiency` 的区别。直接跨导向比较原生 `score` "
"列，会把压缩因子与扩张因子混在一起。本例只有单项投入和单项产出，因此协调后的 CRS 效率恰好相同；但投入导向与产出导向实验所保障的数量仍然不同。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:399
#: 13bef09505804b1997ff1a34ca205013
msgid "When a score of one does not close the operating account"
msgstr "得分为 1 时，经营账户仍可能没有闭合"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:401
#: 9c0248cf78644fd0ae8498a9bdbe7917
msgid ""
"A radial score tests one deliberately simple operating rule: change every "
"represented input, or every represented output, by the same percentage. That"
" rule can be exhausted because one protected quantity prevents a further "
"common movement, even though another resource or service still has a "
"separately attainable improvement."
msgstr "径向得分检验一条有意保持简单的经营规则：所有代表性投入，或者所有代表性产出，按同一百分比变化。某项受到保障的数量可能阻止进一步的共同调整，使这一规则已经用尽；但另一项资源或服务仍可能存在可以单独实现的改进。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:407
#: 959acd8e252e46d9be82515baa173855
msgid ""
"Three branches make the distinction exact. A uses one resource unit to "
"supply one service unit. B uses two resource units for the same service. C "
"uses one resource unit but supplies only one half unit of service. The "
"input-oriented VRS question for C asks whether its *resource* can fall while"
" its recorded service is protected. It does not initially ask whether "
"service could rise."
msgstr ""
"三个分支机构可以准确展示这一差别。A 用 1 单位资源提供 1 单位服务；B 用 2 单位资源提供同样服务；C 用 1 单位资源却只提供 0.5 "
"单位服务。对 C 的投入导向 VRS 问题是：在保障其记录服务的前提下，*资源*能否减少。第一阶段并不询问服务能否增加。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:413
#: 1cff716328444177b9922faa55e53d35
msgid ""
"Branch C uses one resource unit to provide half a service unit. Its input-"
"oriented VRS radial factor is theta equal to one, so the phase-one "
"proportional target remains one resource and one-half service. A separately "
"supported completion holds theta fixed and raises service by one-half to the"
" selected final target of one resource and one service. C is radially "
"efficient but not strongly efficient."
msgstr ""
"分支机构 C 使用 1 单位资源提供 0.5 单位服务。其投入导向 VRS 径向因子 theta 等于 1，因此第一阶段的比例目标仍为 1 单位资源和 "
"0.5 单位服务。另一个有证据支持的补全方案保持 theta 不变，把服务增加 0.5，得到所选最终目标：1 单位资源、1 单位服务。C "
"径向有效，但并非强有效。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:418
#: 7b12c5da13f342a39c8902ce3a83144b
msgid ""
"One observed operation, two supported conclusions. The proportional "
"programme finds no common resource saving for C; the completion account "
"still finds a service opportunity of 0.5. The final target is conditional on"
" the fitted technology and completion rule, not an implementation sequence "
"or management order."
msgstr ""
"同一个观测经营方案得到两项有证据支持的结论。比例规划没有为 C 找到共同资源节约；补全账户仍识别出 0.5 "
"单位的服务机会。最终目标取决于拟合技术和补全规则，不是实施顺序或管理命令。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:424
#: b111a8f0823f41e283129ff61e4846fc
msgid ""
"For C, $\\theta_C=1$ leaves the phase-one plan at resource $1$ and service "
"$0.5$. The statement is precise but narrow: no common input contraction is "
"represented as feasible. Branch A nevertheless shows that the same resource "
"can support service $1$. Holding the radial optimum fixed, phase two "
"therefore records zero additional resource saving, a service slack of $0.5$,"
" and the completed target $(1,1)$. C is radially efficient but not strongly "
"efficient."
msgstr ""
"对 C 而言，$\\theta_C=1$ 使第一阶段方案保持为资源 $1$、服务 "
"$0.5$。这个结论准确但范围有限：生产证据不支持共同压缩投入。然而，分支机构 A 表明同样的资源可以支持服务 "
"$1$。因此，第二阶段在保持径向最优值不变时，记录到额外资源节约为零、服务松弛量为 $0.5$，补全目标为 $(1,1)$。C 径向有效，但并非强有效。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:431
#: 1c535c338e154f38961d51cf50e8502f
msgid "The operating account for a general input-oriented fit is"
msgstr "一般投入导向拟合的经营账户为"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:433
#: c3a4092ec3b745e19a54b1605b9039b4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"x_o^{R}=\\theta_o x_o,\n"
"\\qquad y_o^{R}=y_o,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\widehat x_o=x_o^{R}-s_o^-,\n"
"\\qquad \\widehat y_o=y_o^{R}+s_o^+.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"x_o^{R}=\\theta_o x_o,\n"
"\\qquad y_o^{R}=y_o,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\widehat x_o=x_o^{R}-s_o^-,\n"
"\\qquad \\widehat y_o=y_o^{R}+s_o^+.\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:441
#: 4a11cf6c5d684e8191ea0c96a13b943a
msgid ""
"The superscript $R$ denotes the phase-one proportional plan; a hat denotes "
"the selected completed plan. The `targets` table reports the hatted plan, "
"not an unlabeled copy of $\\theta_o x_o,y_o$. The accompanying operating "
"ledger reconstructs and labels the intermediate radial plan so that a reader"
" cannot silently attribute the later service gain to the radial percentage."
msgstr ""
"上标 $R$ 表示第一阶段比例方案，帽号表示所选的补全方案。`targets` 表报告带帽号的方案，而不是未加说明地复制 $\\theta_o "
"x_o,y_o$。配套的经营明细表会重构并标明中间径向方案，避免读者把后来增加的服务错误归因于径向百分比。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:447
#: cbb862bd237c42ce9ddf2ae7075bec81
msgid "The exact account is reproducible through the complete BCC-I preset:"
msgstr "完整的 BCC-I 预设可以精确复现这一账户："

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:471
#: e4d7e6cc00304880943483604d278fad
msgid ""
"Under output orientation the same accounting logic reverses roles: phase one"
" holds the input caps and scales every represented output by $\\phi$; "
"completion may then expose an additional input saving or output gain without"
" changing $\\phi$."
msgstr ""
"产出导向采用相同的核算逻辑，但两侧角色互换：第一阶段保持投入上限不变，并按 $\\phi$ "
"放大每项代表性产出；补全步骤随后可能识别额外的投入节约或产出增加，却不改变 $\\phi$。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:476
#: 5398fc152d3449819eb9d05a33de2a01
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This is the distinction between radial efficiency and Pareto--Koopmans "
"strong efficiency {cite:p}`koopmans1951,charnes1985`. A plan is strongly "
"efficient under the declared technology when no other feasible plan uses no "
"more of every eligible input and supplies no less of every desirable output,"
" with a strict improvement in at least one quantity. Thus $\\theta=1$ "
"establishes only that no common input reduction remains; it does not "
"establish that every individual resource excess and service shortfall is "
"zero. The analogous warning applies when an output-oriented expansion factor"
" reaches one."
msgstr ""
"这正是径向效率与 Pareto--Koopmans 强效率之间的区别 "
"{cite:p}`koopmans1951,charnes1985`。在所声明技术下，如果不存在另一个可行方案能够使用不多于每项合格投入的数量、提供不少于每项合意产出的数量，并至少严格改善其中一项，则该方案为强有效。因此，$\\theta=1$"
" 只说明不存在进一步的共同投入压缩，并不能说明每项资源冗余和服务不足都已为零。产出导向扩张因子达到 1 时，同样需要这一提醒。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:485
#: 2f53aedbf01c46a19280e24290573e1a
msgid ""
"DEAPack's complete radial presets preserve the common-percentage result and,"
" when the evidence supports it, supply a slack-completed target such as C's "
"$(1,1)$ plan. The completion does not revise the radial score or create a "
"different efficiency model; it makes the remaining operating gaps visible. "
"If the evidence does not support a completed target, only the radial "
"conclusion has been established. An absent target or slack ledger is not "
"evidence that every remaining improvement is zero."
msgstr ""
"DEAPack 的完整径向预设会保留共同比例结果，并在证据支持时提供松弛量补全目标，例如 C 的 $(1,1)$ "
"方案。补全步骤既不修改径向得分，也不创造另一个效率模型；它只是把剩余经营缺口显示出来。如果证据不支持补全目标，则只能认为径向结论已经成立。目标或松弛量明细缺失，不代表所有剩余改进均为零。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:493
#: 358565e0c917481f89fcc0565edd1120
msgid "What a slack-completed target does—and does not—mean"
msgstr "松弛量补全目标能够说明什么，又不能说明什么"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:495
#: 50b02fafe444435a811f25e4732519e1
msgid ""
"A slack-completed target is one strongly efficient operating plan under the "
"declared technology and completion rule. It is not necessarily the closest "
"target, the cheapest transition, or the only optimal target. “Strong” refers"
" to the absence of a further represented input saving or desirable-output "
"gain; it does not mean that the plan is uniquely best for management."
msgstr "松弛量补全目标是所声明技术和补全规则下的一个强有效经营方案。它不一定是最近的目标、成本最低的转型方案或唯一的最优目标。“强”指不存在可进一步实现的投入节约或合意产出增加，并不表示该方案对管理层而言具有唯一最优性。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:501
#: d8768ab02cd74b208fc5492e137cd37b
msgid ""
"Peer intensities have the same boundary. They show which observed activities"
" support the selected benchmark. A positive intensity is evidence used by "
"the model, not a finding that the peer's management practice caused its "
"performance or that the evaluated organization should imitate it literally. "
"Convex combinations are operationally persuasive only when divisible "
"capacity, time sharing, or portfolio mixing makes those combinations "
"credible."
msgstr "参照强度也有同样的解释边界。它们表明哪些观测生产活动支持所选标杆。正的强度是模型采用了相应证据，并不能说明活跃参照单元的管理实践造成了其绩效，也不能说明被评价组织应当原样模仿。只有当可分割产能、分时安排或业务组合能够使凸组合具有现实意义时，这种组合在经营上才有说服力。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:509
#: e8be7a144df74a48ac3f96a2810466c9
msgid ""
"The presets do not settle other parts of the study. The analyst must still "
"declare the variables, eligible reference observations, period policy, "
"measurement quality, and whether CRS or VRS is economically defensible. "
"Ordinary radial DEA also does not guess how an undesirable output may be "
"reduced. A study containing pollution, adverse events, or another jointly "
"produced burden must move to an explicit environmental production account."
msgstr ""
"这些预设并没有解决研究的其他部分。分析者仍须声明变量、合格参照观测、时期政策、测量质量，以及 CRS 或 VRS 在经济上是否可信。普通径向 DEA "
"也不会猜测非合意产出应如何减少。包含污染、不良事件或其他联合生产负担的研究，必须转向明确的环境生产账户。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:516
#: aa226718aedd45b091eccff27d4c26fa
msgid ""
"This completion claim is deliberately narrow: ordinary adjustable inputs and"
" desirable outputs in the declared convex free-disposal technology. "
"Pollution, fixed commitments, and non-convex benchmark rights require their "
"own production accounts; the existence of a quantity called a target does "
"not make their dominance conditions identical."
msgstr "这里的补全主张刻意保持狭窄：它只适用于所声明凸自由处置技术中的普通可调整投入和合意产出。污染、固定承诺与非凸标杆构造权需要各自的生产账户；一个数量被称为目标，并不意味着这些账户具有相同的支配条件。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:522
#: a60ab53b9bc34859a6ce3f8baa69e012
msgid "Report the question, not only the percentage"
msgstr "报告绩效问题，而不只是百分比"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:524
#: df2ed8e19d734f17ae01945f13c4bb2a
msgid ""
"A responsible finding keeps the comparison contract attached. CCR and BCC "
"remain useful shorthand for CRS and VRS, and the I or O suffix states what "
"management protects. The software constructors preserve those complete "
"historical labels, but the report should lead with the operating meaning. "
"For example:"
msgstr ""
"负责任的研究结论应始终附带比较契约。CCR 和 BCC 仍是 CRS 与 VRS 的实用简称，I 或 O "
"后缀则说明管理层保障什么。软件构造器保留这些完整的历史标签，但报告应首先说明其经营含义。例如："

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:529
#: 1892ce2bd9ad4f82a6e91965daa4758d
msgid ""
"Relative to the eligible branches and the declared convex VRS technology, "
"branch E has an input-oriented radial efficiency of 0.667. The fitted "
"benchmark preserves E's recorded service while using two-thirds of its "
"represented controllable resource. This is a model-supported operating "
"opportunity, not a causal estimate or an instruction to remove one-third of "
"the branch's budget."
msgstr ""
"相对于合格分支机构和所声明的凸 VRS 技术，分支机构 E 的投入导向径向效率为 0.667。拟合标杆保障 E "
"记录的服务，同时只使用其代表性可控资源的三分之二。这是模型支持的经营机会，不是因果估计，也不是要求削减该分支机构三分之一预算的指令。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:536
#: 4c325e3990f84ef99da1ae8fb13200b1
msgid ""
"That sentence names the reference population, scale assumption, orientation,"
" score meaning, and conclusion boundary. Targets, slacks, and peers can then"
" show why the model supports the comparison."
msgstr "这句话说明了参照总体、规模报酬假设、导向、得分含义和结论边界。随后可以通过目标方案、松弛量和活跃参照单元解释模型为何支持这一比较。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/03-classical-radial.md:540
#: 2621201d3abc47cdb09d09983d9eed6d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The FDH section above changes benchmark rights while retaining the radial "
"performance question. The following {doc}`scale-performance-management` "
"chapter separates a CRS--VRS scale gap from local operating response. "
"Readers interested in variable-specific resource excesses and output "
"shortfalls can continue directly to {doc}`04-sbm`. When desirable production"
" is inseparable from an undesirable outcome, begin instead with the "
"environmental production question in {doc}`../03-environmental/06"
"-undesirable-outputs-ddf`."
msgstr ""
"上面的 FDH 部分改变了标杆构造权，但保留径向绩效问题。接下来的 {doc}`scale-performance-management` 一章把 "
"CRS--VRS 规模差距与局部经营反应区分开来。关注逐项资源冗余和产出不足的读者，可以直接阅读 "
"{doc}`04-sbm`。如果合意生产与某项非合意结果不可分割，则应从 {doc}`../03-environmental/06"
"-undesirable-outputs-ddf` 的环境生产问题入手。"
